    "source_unit_id": "SU-ff3288afbaade6b7e74e930a",
    "subsection": null,
    "table_id": null,
    "table_label": null,
    "text": "Progression-free survival was significantly longer in the BRCA mutant (hazard ratio 0·27, 95% CI 0·16-0·44, p<0·0001) and LOH high (0·62, 0·42-0·90, p=0·011) subgroups compared with the LOH low subgroup.",
    "unit_type": "ABSTRACT_SENTENCE"
  },
  {
    "bbox": null,
    "caption": null,
    "char_end": 2999,
    "char_start": 2789,
    "column": null,
    "content_hash": "b470568aa7f0efdad9e8f653ffab93a226f567926b448b402fb106514ab6f777",
