    "row": null,
    "section": null,
    "sentence_index": 20,
    "source_unit_id": "SU-b470568aa7f0efdad9e8f653",
    "subsection": null,
    "table_id": null,
    "table_label": null,
    "text": "The most common grade 3 or worse treatment-emergent adverse events were anaemia or decreased haemoglobin (45 [22%] patients), and elevations in alanine aminotransferase or aspartate aminotransferase (25 [12%]).",
    "unit_type": "ABSTRACT_SENTENCE"
  },
  {
    "bbox": null,
    "caption": null,
    "char_end": 3161,
    "char_start": 3000,
    "column": null,
    "content_hash": "3b85307c2b4d9c0ad2b9d214a5663ab8f0939e0cd9ada19414f600a87b0b36a7",
    "document_id": "pmid:27908594",
    "figure_id": null,
    "figure_label": null,
    "locator_confidence": "STRUCTURAL",
    "page": null,
    "paragraph_index": null,
    "parser": "PubMedAbstractParser",
    "parser_version": "1.0",
    "row": null,
    "section": null,
    "sentence_index": 21,
    "source_unit_id": "SU-3b85307c2b4d9c0ad2b9d214",
    "subsection": null,
    "table_id": null,
    "table_label": null,
    "text": "Common serious adverse events included small intestinal obstruction (10 [5%] of 204 patients), malignant neoplasm progression (10 [5%]), and anaemia (nine [4%]).",
    "unit_type": "ABSTRACT_SENTENCE"
  },
  {
    "bbox": null,
    "caption": null,
    "char_end": 3286,
    "char_start": 3162,
    "column": null,
    "content_hash": "45a054e657f59c2b71086e1bfb5a517d7642b9a624b8b869780f6d54f177e187",
    "document_id": "pmid:27908594",
    "figure_id": null,
    "figure_label": null,
    "locator_confidence": "STRUCTURAL",
    "page": null,
    "paragraph_index": null,
    "parser": "PubMedAbstractParser",
    "parser_version": "1.0",
    "row": null,
    "section": null,
    "sentence_index": 22,
    "source_unit_id": "SU-45a054e657f59c2b71086e1b",
    "subsection": null,
    "table_id": null,
    "table_label": null,
    "text": "Three patients died during the study (two because of disease progression and one because of sepsis and disease progression).",
    "unit_type": "ABSTRACT_SENTENCE"
  },
  {
    "bbox": null,
    "caption": null,
    "char_end": 3324,
    "char_start": 3287,
    "column": null,
    "content_hash": "65b32c6277ceb721f03dcf06aeb8c684aeb9b40c057cf78bfbb98cd929340881",
    "document_id": "pmid:27908594",
    "figure_id": null,
    "figure_label": null,
    "locator_confidence": "STRUCTURAL",
    "page": null,
    "paragraph_index": null,
    "parser": "PubMedAbstractParser",
